            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I don't have any concrete plans on integrating LLMs into 'mini.nvim'. Yet.\r\n\r\nMy current idea is something along the lines of a general purpose 'mini.repl' for REPLs (Read-Eval-Print-Loops) with configurable backends. This way it can be used both by interactive \"programming\" (IPython, R, Julia, etc.) and \"chatting\" (conversational LLMs) purposes.",
